Adaptation 01-model-routing-and-autonomy

Claude-side roles run on Opus and Fable only at xhigh effort, Codex on Sol at high; planning and advice take the
host's advisor route. poteto-mode works without asking only on the local machine and pauses before push,
deploy, publish, send, any external write, credentials or scope expansion. Updated for pstack 0.15.46 /
pstack-claude 0.9.153 where architect, how, reflect and why no longer carry separate Models sections.
Use a model-neutral example to show reasoning suffix syntax.

Fork source: https://github.com/mneves75/pstack-claude commits 80d8fde, 5cadccb, 4f82ca1, bb07856 (rebased to 1ab6b82).
Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

